                <h2 id="privacy" data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-3xl md:text-4xl xl:text-5xl font-medium font-[Poppins] mb-2 text-left text-white">
                    PRIVACY POLICY – HAIRLESS
                </h2>
                <p data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-light font-[Poppins] mb-6 text-left text-white">
                    HAIRLESS (“we,” “us,” or “our”) values your privacy and is committed to protecting your personal information.
                </p>
                <p data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-light font-[Poppins] mb-6 text-left text-white">
                    This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your information in compliance with the <strong class="font-semibold">California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA)</strong> and other applicable U.S. privacy laws.
                </p>

                <!-- 1. Information We Collect -->
                <h2 data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-3xl md:text-4xl xl:text-5xl font-medium font-[Poppins] mt-4 mb-2 text-left text-white">
                    1. Information We Collect
                </h2>
                <p data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-light font-[Poppins] mb-6 text-left text-white">
                    We may collect the following data:
                </p>
                <ul class="list-disc list-inside">
                    <li data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-light font-[Poppins] mb-6 text-left text-white"><strong class="font-semibold">Personal Information:</strong> Name, email address, phone number, age, and city/state.</li>
                    <li data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-light font-[Poppins] mb-6 text-left text-white"><strong class="font-semibold">Health-related Information:</strong> Photos, forms, or medical background submitted voluntarily for consultation.</li>
                    <li data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-light font-[Poppins] mb-6 text-left text-white"><strong class="font-semibold">Technical Data:</strong> IP address, browser type, device ID, and analytics data gathered via cookies or tracking pixels.</li>
                </ul>

                <!-- 2. How We Use Your Information -->
                <h2 data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-3xl md:text-4xl xl:text-5xl font-medium font-[Poppins] mt-4 mb-2 text-left text-white">
                    2. How We Use Your Information
                </h2>
                <p data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-light font-[Poppins] mb-6 text-left text-white">
                    Your data may be used to:
                </p>
                <ul class="list-disc list-inside">
                    <li data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-light font-[Poppins] mb-6 text-left text-white">Provide and manage consultations or follow-up communications.</li>
                    <li data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-light font-[Poppins] mb-6 text-left text-white">Schedule appointments or virtual assessments.</li>
                    <li data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-light font-[Poppins] mb-6 text-left text-white">Improve the website, content, and user experience.</li>
                    <li data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-light font-[Poppins] mb-6 text-left text-white">Ensure compliance with applicable laws and prevent misuse or fraud.</li>
                </ul>
                <p data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-light font-[Poppins] mb-6 text-left text-white">
                    We will <strong class="font-semibold">never sell or rent</strong> your personal data.
                </p>

                <!-- 3. Legal Basis for Processing -->
                <h2 data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-3xl md:text-4xl xl:text-5xl font-medium font-[Poppins] mt-4 mb-2 text-left text-white">
                    3. Legal Basis for Processing
                </h2>
                <p data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-light font-[Poppins] mb-6 text-left text-white">
                    We process personal data based on:
                </p>
                <ul class="list-disc list-inside">
                    <li data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-light font-[Poppins] mb-6 text-left text-white">Your <strong class="font-semibold">consent,</strong> when you submit information.</li>
                    <li data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-light font-[Poppins] mb-6 text-left text-white"><strong class="font-semibold">Performance of services</strong> when you book or communicate with us.</li>
                    <li data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-light font-[Poppins] mb-6 text-left text-white"><strong class="font-semibold">Legitimate interest</strong> in improving and securing our platform.</li>
                </ul>

                <!-- 4. Sharing and Disclosure -->
                <h2 data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-3xl md:text-4xl xl:text-5xl font-medium font-[Poppins] mt-4 mb-2 text-left text-white">
                    4. Sharing and Disclosure
                </h2>
                <p data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-light font-[Poppins] mb-6 text-left text-white">
                    We may share limited information only with:
                </p>
                <ul class="list-disc list-inside">
                    <li data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-light font-[Poppins] mb-6 text-left text-white">Licensed medical professionals involved in your consultation.</li>
                    <li data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-light font-[Poppins] mb-6 text-left text-white">Service providers that help operate our systems (CRM, hosting, analytics), bound by confidentiality.</li>
                    <li data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-light font-[Poppins] mb-6 text-left text-white">Law enforcement or regulatory bodies, when legally required.</li>
                </ul>

                <!-- 5. Retention -->
                <h2 data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-3xl md:text-4xl xl:text-5xl font-medium font-[Poppins] mt-4 mb-2 text-left text-white">
                    5. Retention
                </h2>
                <p data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-light font-[Poppins] mb-6 text-left text-white">
                    Personal information is retained only as long as necessary to fulfill service or legal obligations.
                </p>
                <p data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-light font-[Poppins] mb-6 text-left text-white">
                    You may request deletion of your records at any time (see Section 8).
                </p>

                <!-- 6. Cookies & Analytics -->
                <h2 data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-3xl md:text-4xl xl:text-5xl font-medium font-[Poppins] mt-4 mb-2 text-left text-white">
                    6. Cookies & Analytics
                </h2>
                <p data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-light font-[Poppins] mb-6 text-left text-white">
                    HAIRLESS uses cookies and analytics tools to enhance navigation and evaluate traffic trends.
                </p>
                <p data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-light font-[Poppins] mb-6 text-left text-white">
                    You can disable cookies in your browser settings, though some site functions may be affected.
                </p>

                <!-- 7. Data Security -->
                <h2 data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-3xl md:text-4xl xl:text-5xl font-medium font-[Poppins] mt-4 mb-2 text-left text-white">
                    7. Data Security
                </h2>
                <p data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-light font-[Poppins] mb-6 text-left text-white">
                    We implement administrative, physical, and technical measures to safeguard your data.
                </p>
                <p data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-light font-[Poppins] mb-6 text-left text-white">
                    However, no transmission over the Internet is 100% secure, and you acknowledge this risk when using our site.
                </p>

                <!-- 8. Your Privacy Rights (CCPA / GDPR) -->
                <h2 data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-3xl md:text-4xl xl:text-5xl font-medium font-[Poppins] mt-4 mb-2 text-left text-white">
                    8. Your Privacy Rights (CCPA / GDPR)
                </h2>
                <p data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-light font-[Poppins] mb-6 text-left text-white">
                    You may at any time:
                </p>
                <ul class="list-disc list-inside">
                    <li data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-light font-[Poppins] mb-6 text-left text-white"><strong class="font-semibold">Request access to your personal data.</li>
                    <li data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-light font-[Poppins] mb-6 text-left text-white"><strong class="font-semibold">Request correction or deletion of your information.</li>
                    <li data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-light font-[Poppins] mb-6 text-left text-white"><strong class="font-semibold">Withdraw consent for data processing.</li>
                    <li data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-light font-[Poppins] mb-6 text-left text-white"><strong class="font-semibold">Request details about how your data has been shared.</li>
                </ul>
                <p data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-light font-[Poppins] mb-6 text-left text-white">
                    Submit your request to <strong class="font-semibold"><a href="mailto:info@hairlesstj.com" target="_self" data-type="url">info@hairlesstj.com</a></strong>. We will respond within 30 days of verifying your identity.
                </p>

                <!-- 9. Minors -->
                <h2 data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-3xl md:text-4xl xl:text-5xl font-medium font-[Poppins] mt-4 mb-2 text-left text-white">
                    9. Minors
                </h2>
                <p data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-light font-[Poppins] mb-6 text-left text-white">
                    Our Services are intended for individuals aged 18 and older.
                </p>
                <p data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-light font-[Poppins] mb-6 text-left text-white">
                    We do not knowingly collect data from minors.
                </p>

                <!-- 10. International Users -->
                <h2 data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-3xl md:text-4xl xl:text-5xl font-medium font-[Poppins] mt-4 mb-2 text-left text-white">
                    10. International Users
                </h2>
                <p data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-lg md:text-xl xl:text-2xl font-light font-[Poppins] mb-6 text-left text-white">
                    If you access the site from outside the U.S., your data may be processed in the United States, where privacy laws may differ.
                </p>

                <!-- 11. Policy Updates -->
                <h2 data-animation="animate__pulse" class="animate__animated text-3xl md:text-4xl xl:text-5xl font-medium font-[Poppins] mt-4 mb-2 text-left text-white">
                    11. Policy Updates
